---
source: crates/specforge-cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Format .spec files

Usage: specforge format [OPTIONS] [PATHS]...

Arguments:
  [PATHS]...
          Explicit file or directory paths to format

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          Path to the spec root directory
          
          [default: .]

      --check
          Check formatting without modifying files (exit 1 if unformatted)

      --diff
          Show unified diff of formatting changes

      --stdin
          Read from stdin, write to stdout

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
